{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Online Records</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Records is an episodic psychological horror game where each story tells unsettling events that could happen to anyone\u2026 even you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Episode 1: Unknown Seller</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 22-year-old student arranges to meet an online seller at their home to pick up an item. At first, everything seems normal, but as she steps inside, an eerie feeling creeps in. What was supposed to be a simple transaction quickly turns into an experience she will never forget.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Records is a first-person narrative experience with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive and gripping story</strong>, based on everyday events that take a sinister turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS aesthetics and realistic graphics</strong> for a truly atmospheric experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time messages</strong> that add depth to the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices and consequences</strong> that shape the outcome.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to face the unknown?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565030?t=1741162664","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3565030?t=1741162664","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565030/4f79ed76db31f6857ab617e7c19065babb58bc27/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741162664","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565030/4f79ed76db31f6857ab617e7c19065babb58bc27/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741162664","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Online Records</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Records is an episodic psychological horror game where each story tells unsettling events that could happen to anyone\u2026 even you.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Episode 1: Unknown Seller</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A 22-year-old student arranges to meet an online seller at their home to pick up an item. At first, everything seems normal, but as she steps inside, an eerie feeling creeps in. What was supposed to be a simple transaction quickly turns into an experience she will never forget.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online Records is a first-person narrative experience with exploration and interaction mechanics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive and gripping story</strong>, based on everyday events that take a sinister turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>VHS aesthetics and realistic graphics</strong> for a truly atmospheric experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Real-time messages</strong> that add depth to the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choices and consequences</strong> that shape the outcome.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to face the unknown?</p>","developers":["Catire Games Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3565030/1004a06c544cbc4f8977895e643589748c96667a/header.jpg?t=1741162664","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name"